    "result_text": "All 23 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipNumber` assignment, formatted `'<customerCode>-M<YY>'` where `YY` is the last two digits of the `registrationDate` year.\n\nChanges made:\n\n- **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added a `membershipNumber` field (mapped to `membership_number`) with getter/setter, following the existing `customerCode`/`namesakeCount` pattern.\n- **`OwnerRestControllerV1.java`** \u2014 added a `membershipNumberFor(customerCode, registrationDate)` helper using `String.format(\"%s-M%02d\", customerCode, registrationDate.getYear() % 100)`, and invoked it in `addOwner` right after the `customerCode` is assigned (and after `registrationDate` is defaulted to today), so the value is derived purely from the owner's own fields.\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the read-only `membershipNumber` property to the `Owner` schema so it's exposed in the API/DTO (MapStruct maps it automatically by name).\n- **schema.sql** (h2, hsqldb, postgres, mysql) \u2014 added the `membership_number` column to the `owners` table.\n\nThe new `Cp14Tests` and all 23 existing tests are green.",
